# Kasmina's Transmutation removes both the cast trigger and the untap restriction (CR 613.1f). Ornithopter no longer
# untaps Traxos, but the next untap step does. Disenchant restores the abilities; its next attack stays tapped through
# another untap step, then a new artifact cast untaps it (CR 502.3/603.2). Both sides of ability loss are exercised.

